Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:19:55 +0000
Subject: feat(compose): add holdRefreshInset to pullToRefreshItem

Add holdRefreshInset (default true, current behaviour). When false the
list does not keep the refreshThreshold top inset while refreshing:
release goes straight to IDLE, clears the end-drag and current insets,
and still calls onRefresh once.
Rebased onto upstream #1582 (withFrameNanos failsafe and
suppressIdleInsetReset kept; the REFRESHING branch clears the flag
before choosing held vs. non-held inset).

Fork-Patch: compose-ptr-hold-refresh-inset
Origin: 35290a17
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

